      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1791 the Providence and Norwich Turnpike, now Plainfield Pike, was chartered, linking Johnston to regional trade.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18
